        seo_texto: "<details class='seo-accordion' style='max-width: 600px; margin: 15px auto; padding: 0; border: none; background: transparent; text-align: left; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-color, #333); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0.8;'><summary style='font-weight: 500; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-color, #333); opacity: 0.6; outline: none; user-select: none; list-style: none;'>ℹ️ About the app (Metro SP)</summary><div style='padding: 15px 5px 5px 5px; line-height: 1.6; cursor: default;' onclick='event.stopPropagation();'><p><strong>SP Trilhos</strong> is a public utility progressive web application designed to simplify navigation for citizens and tourists across the rail network of the São Paulo Metropolitan Region. The app provides smart tools based on graph algorithms to optimally calculate the best route between any starting point and final destination.</p><h4 style='margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #00539B; font-size: 13px;'>Smart Routes and Complete Coverage</h4><p>Our platform offers geolocation and map support for all lines operated by different concessionaires in São Paulo. Plan your route and check integrated connections for <strong>Line 1-Blue</strong>, <strong>Line 2-Green</strong>, <strong>Line 3-Red</strong>, <strong>Line 4-Yellow</strong>, <strong>Line 5-Lilac</strong>, plus all CPTM metropolitan lines like <strong>Line 7-Ruby</strong>, <strong>Line 11-Coral</strong>, <strong>Line 12-Sapphire</strong> and ViaMobilidade services like <strong>Line 8-Diamond</strong> and <strong>Line 9-Emerald</strong>. Using integrated GPS, the system tracks the user's geographical coordinates to instantly point out the closest station, calculating hybrid routes on foot or integrated with ride-hailing apps.</p><h4 style='margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #00539B; font-size: 13px;'>Real-Time Collaborative Status (Waze-Style)</h4><p>The app's main differentiator is its community intelligence system. Passengers experiencing the daily operation can send malfunction alerts, such as Reduced Speed or Stopped Train/Metro. To prevent false reports, the system features advanced cloud security geofencing logic in Cloudflare Workers, validating if the user is actually within the geographical area of the lines before consolidating their report. When the quorum of valid reports is reached, a real-time community alert is published at the top of the app screen to warn thousands of other users.</p><h4 style='margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #00539B; font-size: 13px;'>Safe and Offline Operation</h4><p>Developed under the PWA standard, SP Trilhos stores its static resources in local browser cache via Service Workers, allowing you to view metropolitan maps and calculate routes even if you are underground or in tunnels without an internet connection. The system operates independently from government agencies, collecting official status data through public portals and unifying them to offer a fluid, transparent, and agile urban mobility experience.</p></div></details>"
